{
  "name": "Mobility Attack II",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR11 or higher. You may make a [Normal Move] up to your [Speed] Sq. During this Main Process, you gain a +[SRx[DEX mod]] bonus to [Weapon Attack] damage rolls.</p>\n<p>(Minor): Increase the distance moved by +1 Sq.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A skill that provides a run-up for subsequent attacks. The momentum from sprinting is directly converted into striking power. Storm across the battlefield, your blade weaving constant death.</p>",
